  "systemRulesContent": "VIP Reward System Rules:\n\n1. Reward Distribution Rules\n   - Daily rewards: Members can claim daily rewards within the specified period after meeting wagering requirements\n   - Weekly rewards: Distributed every Monday based on last week's activity\n   - Monthly rewards: Distributed on the 1st of each month based on VIP level and monthly performance\n   - Birthday rewards: Special rewards available on member's birthday, once per year\n\n2. Distribution Conditions & Limits\n   - Reward amounts are calculated based on VIP level, wagering activity, and history\n   - Single rewards cannot exceed the maximum cap for each type\n   - Members must complete wagering requirements before withdrawal\n   - Different terminals may have different reward policies\n\n3. Promotion Bonus\n   - Members receive promotion bonus when VIP level increases\n   - Based on new level standards, non-repeatable\n   - Must be claimed within the specified period or forfeited\n\n4. Other Terms\n   - Rewards valid for 7 calendar days, then expire\n   - Platform may suspend rewards for abnormal accounts\n   - Platform may reclaim rewards for violations\n   - Disputes resolved per system records and platform decision\n   - Platform reserves final interpretation rights"
